        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I'm out for presidents to represent me (It's Easy Mac, dog; Get money)",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I'm out for dead **** presidents to represent me (Yeah, yeah; Whose)",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AAAA",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AAAA"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Please acknowledge me, fuck the dreams of equality",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"I oughta be a leader but ain't nobody follow me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"World wants to swallow me right into the dirt",
          "rhyme":"9Rt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"But fuck that, I'd rather a clique put three in my shirt",
          "rhyme":"9Rt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"I'm headed to Heaven, crash landin' in Hell",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"My moms ain't understand that she's the man, I rebel",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Got me trapped like a cell, so I put on some L",
          "rhyme":"l",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"And lay back ASAP, I'ma yell my farewells",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"I excel from the other side of the world",
          "rhyme":"Old",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Where the grass is greener and the shells carry pearls",
          "rhyme":"9Rl",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"And I'm here now, but one day I'll be gone",
          "rhyme":"on",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Until then I smoke a big L and put it on",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"'Cause I just live my life like that",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Instead of fightin' back, I chill and write rap",
          "rhyme":"ap",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"'Cause I dream of the day where people pay to have my songs",
          "rhyme":"$g",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"You hate my style 'cause it's ancient like Babylon",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"And when rap is gone, I'll be too",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"You won't see me anymore, but I'll see you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"And free you? Nah, I'll think I'll keep you a slave",
          "rhyme":"av",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"'Cause your mind is in the dark like the back of the cave",
          "rhyme":"av",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"And back in the day, well, I wasn't here",
          "rhyme":"eR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"Visine in my eyes, still nothin' is clear",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"If hip-hop is dead, then I'm the resurrection",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"Represented by presidents, all same complexions",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCCDDEDFGHIJKLIMNOOPQII",
