    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I got a target on my chest, red dot on my head",
          "rhyme":"Ed",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"I be hidin' from the monsters I got under my bed",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Everybody has their demons, leave 'em preyin' on his needs",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"AIDS-infested semen, leave 'em cleanin' this disease",
          "rhyme":"iz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"The words without a meanin', I be fiendin' for the trees",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"It's Easy Mac, I'll be mackin' it with ease",
          "rhyme":"iz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I'm the king of the land, the air and the seas",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Please, who you know that does it like me?",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"And now my mind's fucked up, like I just took a Valium",
          "rhyme":"Om",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"I'm sorry daddy that I didn't bring back medallions",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"No grades to put up on the fridge",
          "rhyme":"idZ",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"And I'm sorry that I didn't grow up as a kid",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"'Cause I grew up like a man, you need to understand",
          "rhyme":"#d",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"That I know that everything I got was put up in my hand",
          "rhyme":"#d",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Yeah, it's my life, so you need to let me live it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"\"Kid's so privileged\", \"Kid is so gifted\"",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"You never liked my fitteds, call me The Mad Hatter",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"But I'm killin' wack rappers, cats that rap wacker",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"Thought I act black 'cause I'm saggin' my jeans",
          "rhyme":"ins",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"And I'm just doin' my work while I'm baggin' up weed",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"Yeah, the haters, man, they nothin' to me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"He told me that I gotta work hard, nothin' is free",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"Yeah, it's all in my mind for the paper",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"Mother Earth is mine, I'ma take her",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
